--- !u!114 &4649564163144459059
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7966935541865290600}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 925dbd6673d28fd40a131318b7181f78, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialSequence
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 1179916461720315261}
  tutorialLines1:
  - Congratulations on your employment at Big Happy Burger! Today we're going to
    be going over the basics of your very important job.
  - This here is your station. Bask in its glory!
  - And look! Your very first customer has already arrived. Time to get to work!
  - This monitor shows you the orders you have to fill. Looks like this cheapskate
    only wants FRIES and KETCHUP.
  - That won't take long at all. In fact, I bet the cook is already done making the
    stuff.
  - 'Press D or <- to rotate towards the Hotplate Station! '
  - This screen shows you how much time is left until the food gets done. Looks like
    Chef is pretty slow today. Gonna have to dock his pay again.
  - While he's cooking, let's get a bag ready. Grab one from that slot over there
    by pressing and holding <LEFT-CLICK>!
  - Nice grabbin. I wish I had arms. Now place it on the counter by letting go of
    <LEFT-CLICK>.
  - God, FINALLY! Now we can fulfill the order.
  - You know the drill. Fries in the bag. Use the <SCROLL-WHEEL> to move it closer
    or further. Hurry now, the customer's waiting!!
  - Alright, now we need some ketchup. Grab it from that container over here! Hurry
    hurry!
  - "Oops! Almost forgot the napkins! That\u2019s a hangable offense around here.
    Hahah\u2026"
  - Seriously, put the napkins in.
  - "Alright! Now for the perfect handoff. Hold onto the bag and press A or \u2190
    until you get to the Drive-Thru Window."
  - There they are. Move the bag to the customer to give it to them. Be sure to smile!
  - "Alright! Just do that 1000 more times and you\u2019ll earn a promotion."
  - "Ope, another customer! Hurry up and check the order screen (D or \u2192)."
  - "JUST a soda?! DON\u2019T YOU PEOPLE WANT FOOD??"
  - "Whatever, let\u2019s go to the drink station. Press W or \u2190 twice to get
    there."
  - Now place the cup on the conveyor and watch the magic!
